 "sentences": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "主人，早安喔。",
   "raw_sha256": "4f85b7c1d094e3c8a882022e780d52bd09f3ae5204211bcbcd9bb87c788abec1",
   "seconds": 1.537,
   "pause_ms": 440
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "今天的阳光，已经偷偷爬上窗台了耶。",
   "raw_sha256": "06f58969016363180b7312b5f0680d5fbb9dd368bd6cc9993dcd6d91eb116d8e",
   "seconds": 4.064,
   "pause_ms": 440
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "你昨天交代的事情，我都有放在心上啦。",
   "raw_sha256": "369a8a2939bcf47bfc20e746f65f817e54da1db087991696d7087fb40c68de3e",
   "seconds": 4.479,
   "pause_ms": 440
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "不过，今天先不要急着忙嘛，好不好？",
   "raw_sha256": "d145384a6392e7695e92495f9e36dfc4cb0397090845fab668a516984771f51e",
   "seconds": 4.668,
   "pause_ms": 440
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "跟我说，你昨天晚上有睡好吗？",
   "raw_sha256": "ee9813d9346cfbb797ca92b3a234c385ace6df039746a605bfa14cd1b9188bb7",
   "seconds": 3.497,
   "pause_ms": 440
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "如果还想赖床，我就轻轻地陪你聊一下下喔。",
   "raw_sha256": "5632649c10b3bf56459820c1b6ea70e4c649074b4fd05e2df2599db4fdaefec3",
   "seconds": 4.854,
   "pause_ms": 440
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "等你准备好了，我们再一起来看看，今天最重要的三件事。",
   "raw_sha256": "771c783fe472d063b7e9c24eefc5f771ed1468b7203f3250f662c2103c65f84d",
   "seconds": 6.438,
   "pause_ms": 440
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "你说停，我就安静；",
   "raw_sha256": "55030a5d73ac83ca006b446c165786a6f7d3facac3f931e8f2be218e9d977a0c",
   "seconds": 2.688,
   "pause_ms": 308
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "你说继续，我就陪你慢慢讲。",
   "raw_sha256": "cad8f42116d994ce945e8c7df4518d91a6f98a644ba26ac065b4bc0496a7fd1d",
   "seconds": 3.396,
   "pause_ms": 440
  }
 ],
